iscarding F2 maintains maximum flexibility for forming chows in W suit while keeping the B1 pair as a potential pair for winning. This move keeps me on track for patterns like Half Flush (6 points) or potentially higher-scoring patterns if I draw more W tiles.\n\nAnswer: Play F2"}
